\pard\sa120\f0\fs22\par

\pard\sa220\b\f0\fs24 8. Logical Components\b0\fs22\par
\pard\sa120\f0 1. Dashboard UI\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Responsible for controls, chart mode, and visualization only. It must not know the SolarEdge API key.\par

\pard\sa120\f0 2. API Layer\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Responsible for serving chart-ready data to the browser, reading from the persistence layer, and optionally falling back to live SolarEdge queries when recent data is missing.\par

\pard\sa120\f0 3. Ingestion Service\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Responsible for fetching new SolarEdge data periodically, handling retries, and performing idempotent upserts into the database.\par

\pard\sa120\f0 4. Aggregation Service\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Responsible for producing daily, weekly, monthly, and yearly summaries either on demand or through precomputed rollups.\par

\pard\sa120\f0 5. Persistence Layer\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Responsible for storing raw samples, rollups, sync audit records, and metadata for sites.\par

\pard\sa220\b\f0\fs24 9. Proposed Data Model\b0\fs22\par
\pard\sa120\b\f0 Table: sites\b0\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Stores site identity and metadata.\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Fields: id, external_site_id, name, timezone, created_at.\par

\pard\sa120\b\f0 Table: energy_samples\b0\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Stores raw 15-minute, hourly, or daily measurements.\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Fields: id, site_id, timestamp_utc, granularity, production_wh, consumption_wh, grid_import_wh, grid_export_wh, self_consumed_wh, source, created_at.\par

\pard\sa120\b\f0 Table: energy_rollups_daily\b0\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Stores pre-aggregated daily totals for fast reporting.\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Fields: id, site_id, day_utc, production_wh, consumption_wh, grid_import_wh, grid_export_wh, self_consumed_wh, updated_at.\par

\pard\sa120\b\f0 Table: energy_rollups_monthly\b0\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Stores monthly totals for long-range dashboard queries.\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Fields: id, site_id, month_utc, production_wh, consumption_wh, grid_import_wh, grid_export_wh, self_consumed_wh, updated_at.\par

\pard\sa120\b\f0 Table: sync_runs\b0\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Stores ingestion status and audit history.\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Fields: id, site_id, sync_type, started_at, finished_at, status, records_written, error_message.\par

