\pard\sa220\b\f0\fs24 11. Recommended Access Pattern\b0\fs22\par
\pard\sa120\f0 1. Intraday chart queries use raw 15-minute samples.\par
\pard\sa120\f0 2. Weekly and monthly chart queries can use daily rollups.\par
\pard\sa120\f0 3. Yearly chart queries use monthly rollups.\par
\pard\sa120\f0 4. Live power flow remains a separate direct query if real-time freshness is required.\par

\pard\sa220\b\f0\fs24 12. Scheduling Strategy\b0\fs22\par
\pard\sa120\f0 1. Near-real-time sync every 15 minutes or every hour.\par
\pard\sa120\f0 2. Nightly backfill for the previous day to capture late corrections.\par
\pard\sa120\f0 3. Weekly integrity check to detect missing samples or failed runs.\par

\pard\sa220\b\f0\fs24 13. Reliability and Security Requirements\b0\fs22\par
\pard\sa120\f0 1. SolarEdge API key must remain server-side only.\par
\pard\sa120\f0 2. All timestamps must be stored in UTC.\par
\pard\sa120\f0 3. Raw sample ingestion must be idempotent.\par
\pard\sa120\f0 4. Unique key should be enforced on site_id, timestamp_utc, and granularity.\par
\pard\sa120\f0 5. Failed sync runs must be recorded for diagnosis.\par
\pard\sa120\f0 6. The dashboard should indicate stale data if the latest sync is too old.\par

\pard\sa220\b\f0\fs24 14. Migration Path From Current Project\b0\fs22\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Phase 1: Introduce a repository abstraction for energy reads and writes.\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Phase 2: Add an online database and create the raw sample and sync tables.\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Phase 3: Build an ingestion command and schedule it.\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Phase 4: Change the API to read from the database first.\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Phase 5: Add daily and monthly rollups for performance.\par
\pard\sa120\f0 Phase 6: Add monitoring, stale-data detection, and admin diagnostics.\par

\pard\sa220\b\f0\fs24 15. Final Recommendation\b0\fs22\par
\pard\sa140\f0 The recommended architecture is Supabase plus scheduled ingestion, raw sample persistence, and rollup tables. This architecture preserves free-tier viability while giving the application a scalable and maintainable base for charting, reporting, caching, and future analytics.\par

\pard\sa220\b\f0\fs24 16. Summary\b0\fs22\par
\pard\sa120\f0 The software should evolve from direct API-driven rendering to a persisted data platform. SolarEdge becomes the upstream source of truth, the database becomes the operational data store, the Node API becomes the controlled access layer, and the dashboard becomes a fast consumer of prepared data.\par

\pard\sa200\qc\i\f0 End of specification\i0\par
